{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54531","headline":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 十八 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戊己日，前面有云青。\n忽止忽行权且住（辛本、川本作「急止匆行权住在」，京本作「急止勿行权住寨」，似以京本爲长），军人讹（辛本、川本作「须」）语审详听，施德惠於（京本作「其」）兵（辛本、川本作「施惠得中旌」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54531.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54531","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}